## Success Criteria - All Met ✅

1. ✅ **Connects to Azure AD via Graph API** - OAuth2 client credentials, token refresh
2. ✅ **Tracks sign-in events and failures** - Continuous polling, all error codes mapped
3. ✅ **Monitors privilege changes** - Role assignments, group memberships, PIM activations
4. ✅ **Normalizes to RiskObject schema** - Complete mapping with methodology trails
5. ✅ **Handles Microsoft Graph API rate limits** - Token bucket + exponential backoff
6. ✅ **Health check endpoints** - /health, /ready, /live, /metrics
7. ✅ **MFA failure tracking** - Pattern analysis, suspicious threshold detection

